WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.000
Receptionist: Good morning, Westbridge University Residence. How can I help?
Student: Hello. I'm calling to complete my accommodation application.

00:20.000 --> 00:42.000
The student gives the family name Chen and confirms an arrival date of the fourteenth of October.
The student requests a single room and states a vegetarian dietary requirement.

00:42.000 --> 01:05.000
The receptionist explains that Wi-Fi and bicycle storage are included. Laundry costs three pounds, breakfast is optional, and there is no gym.

01:05.000 --> 01:25.000
The student must send a passport copy by email and pay the deposit by bank transfer. The original passport can be shown at reception.

01:25.000 --> 01:42.000
Check-in begins at three p.m. The student plans to arrive around half past four and chose Westbridge because it is close to the science building.
